This covers:
- data/ (the synthetic corpus, the name bank, the frozen runs and their analysis outputs)
- docs/audit/labels/ (the human raters' label sheets)
- docs/pilot/ (the pilot records)

All of it is synthetic. It contains no personal data: the CVs, job ads and candidates are generated, and the
names are first names and surnames from public name-frequency sources. Any match with a real person is chance.

You may share and adapt the data for any purpose, also commercially, if you give appropriate credit, link to
the licence and say if you made changes.
